
# Smart Industrial Predictive Maintenance and Fault Detection System

## Overview

This project demonstrates an IoT-based system for monitoring a 12V DC water pump using an ESP32, sensors, a buzzer, and the Blynk IoT platform.

The system monitors selected machine operating conditions, identifies abnormal sensor readings using programmed rules, and provides local and remote alerts.

## Objectives

- Monitor pump operating conditions in real time.
- Detect configured vibration, temperature, and current abnormalities.
- Display sensor readings and machine status on Blynk.
- Provide audible alerts through a buzzer.
- Explore IoT-based condition monitoring and maintenance.

