## Safety

- Never power the pump directly from an ESP32 GPIO.
- Use a suitable supply and correctly rated switching hardware.
- Ensure sensor signal voltages are safe for ESP32 inputs.
- Disconnect power before modifying wiring.
- Keep water away from exposed electronics.
- Verify all connections before operating the pump.

